Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of the song \"It's Raining\"?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00", "start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "It's Raining (Irma Thomas song) \"It's Raining\" is a soul/R&B ballad, credited as written by Naomi Neville."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00", "start": 107, "end": 194, "text": "It was first recorded in November 1961 by Irma Thomas, and produced by Allen Toussaint."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00", "start": 195, "end": 400, "text": "The song has emotional ties to Louisiana, having been written and sung by people born in that State, being released on a New Orleans–based record label and enduring in the Deep South as a regional classic."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00", "start": 401, "end": 518, "text": "\"It's Raining\", alongside \"Ruler of My Heart\" and \"I Done Got Over It\", remain some of Thomas' best–known recordings."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d00", "start": 519, "end": 593, "text": "Initially Thomas recorded for Ron Records but, in 1961, she left for Minit"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01", "start": 0, "end": 4, "text": "'' ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01", "start": 5, "end": 15, "text": "AllMusic ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01", "start": 16, "end": 43, "text": "Retrieved August 5 , 2017 ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01", "start": 44, "end": 103, "text": "^ a b c `` IRMA THOMAS - The Soul Queen of New Orleans '' ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01", "start": 104, "end": 117, "text": "Helsinki.fi ."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0280-7683f713116d:d01", "start"